        "original_id": "36299571-e383-5b2e-8a39-ea71d73674e2",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Places: Wildsville, Louisiana; Jonesville; Georgia; Alabama; Colorado\n- Roads: U.S. Route 84\n- Topics: location; route history\n\nFacts:\n- In the original 1926 U.S. highway scheme, U.S. Route 84 was a short route running between Georgia and Alabama.\n- By 1941, U.S. Route 84 had been extended as far as Colorado.\n- Wildsville, Louisiana, is located on U.S. Route 84, 2 miles east of Jonesville.",
